# Store content, not workspace code.
#
# `prompts/nx-monorepo/skeleton/` ships real config files as a template, including
# `apps/proxy/project.json`. Without this, Nx discovers that file and registers a live `proxy`
# project whose targets shell out to paths that only exist in a repo built FROM the skeleton —
# `nx run-many` and `nx release` then fail with `tools/deploy/build.sh: not found`.
prompts
skills
